-  "发消息按钮打开与这台设备的会话 —— 消息长连接优先、HTTP 兜底：已配对的不点「连接」也能收发，未配对设备也能收能发（对端名字是它自报的）；对端不在网上时那条消息排着队，它一上线就自动发出去（界面那一刻写「等待发送」）；已配对设备点「连接」建立长连接（配对本身不建链）；处于长连接的设备会自动收到你拖入悬浮球文件的广播，无需逐条操作；关机时连着长连接的设备，下次启动 OrbDrop 时会自动接回来（点过「断开」的不会）。": "The Message button opens the conversation with this device — messages prefer the live link and fall back to HTTP: paired devices can send and receive without tapping Connect, and unpaired devices can too (the peer name is what it reports about itself). When the peer is offline the message queues and is sent automatically once it comes online (the UI shows “waiting to send” meanwhile). Paired devices tap Connect to open a live link (pairing alone doesn't connect). Devices on a live link automatically receive files you drop on the orb, no per-file action needed. Devices still linked when you shut down reconnect the next time OrbDrop starts (unless Disconnect was tapped).",
+  "点击设备行或「发消息」按钮都能打开与这台设备的会话 —— 消息长连接优先、HTTP 兜底：已配对的不点「连接」也能收发，未配对设备也能收能发（对端名字是它自报的）；对端不在网上时那条消息排着队，它一上线就自动发出去（界面那一刻写「等待发送」）；已配对设备点「连接」建立长连接（配对本身不建链）；处于长连接的设备会自动收到你拖入悬浮球文件的广播，无需逐条操作；关机时连着长连接的设备，下次启动 OrbDrop 时会自动接回来（点过「断开」的不会）。": "Clicking the device row or the Message button opens the conversation with this device — messages prefer the live link and fall back to HTTP: paired devices can send and receive without tapping Connect, and unpaired devices can too (the peer name is what it reports about itself). When the peer is offline the message queues and is sent automatically once it comes online (the UI shows “waiting to send” meanwhile). Paired devices tap Connect to open a live link (pairing alone doesn't connect). Devices on a live link automatically receive files you drop on the orb, no per-file action needed. Devices still linked when you shut down reconnect the next time OrbDrop starts (unless Disconnect was tapped).",
   "已配对但离线的设备排在列表下方（在线的在上），可以「解除配对」—— 解除是本机动作，不需要对方在线。": "Paired but offline devices are listed below online ones and can be unpaired — unpairing is a local action that doesn't need the peer online.",
   "推送在会话里（输入框左边那颗「＋」）：选文件发过去就是推送 —— 一对一发给这一台；「群发」那条会话里同样有那颗「＋」，一次发给名单上的所有设备（各自邀请、各自进度）。上面的新建会话一次选几台、选模式：单向群发是每台各自收到一条单独消息，共享群聊是所有人的同一条消息流（收到邀请的人点「加入」才算入群）；群那条会话里也有那颗「＋」，按名册逐台推过去。": "Push lives in the conversation (the “+” left of the input): pick files and send them to push — one-to-one chats go to this device only; broadcast conversations have the same “+”, sending to every device on the list at once (separate invites, separate progress). New conversation picks several devices and a mode at once: one-way broadcast gives each device its own separate message, while a shared group chat is a single message stream for everyone (invitees must tap Join to enter the group); group conversations also have that “+” to push to each member on the roster.",
   "搜索框只在这里筛显示（显示名或 IP），不影响长连接与消息。": "The search box only filters this list (display name or IP); it doesn't affect links or messages.",
@@ -141,5 +141,8 @@
